{"3962270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Perfume Atelier", "steam_appid": 3962270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>✨ Get it Together Discounted!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/2e01571c62df6c5cc69a6dfc83864162.avif?t=1787721682\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your own little perfume workshop, where every bottle tells a story. 🌸 Mix fragrant essences, design beautiful bottles, and share your creations with curious customers who are searching for scents that match their mood. As your atelier grows, decorate your space, unlock new recipes, and build your reputation in the gentle art of fragrance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/4971be26fb8784c882fab20f4ceab664.poster.avif?t=1787721682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/4971be26fb8784c882fab20f4ceab664.webm?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/4971be26fb8784c882fab20f4ceab664.mp4?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Cozy Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide library of essences, each with its own traits. Mix and match to create perfumes that carry distinct moods, accords, and tones. Every drop counts, so use your ingredients wisely. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Bottle Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself through bottle shapes, caps, labels, and colors. There’s no wrong way to design, each creation is uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/3547331325b4284b095e236f21dfce8c.poster.avif?t=1787721682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/3547331325b4284b095e236f21dfce8c.webm?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/3547331325b4284b095e236f21dfce8c.mp4?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛍️ Shopkeeping</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome curious customers with their own requests and quirks. Wrap bottles, prepare testers, and match perfumes to their tastes. Build a reputation for thoughtfulness and creativity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌿 Progression &amp; Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new essences, recipes, and decorative elements as you grow. Meet the mysterious traveling merchant, take on special orders, and collect rare labels for your perfumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/fb07160a53d007f83a09d7f7670fb4a0.poster.avif?t=1787721682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/fb07160a53d007f83a09d7f7670fb4a0.webm?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/fb07160a53d007f83a09d7f7670fb4a0.mp4?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Will your atelier become a treasured stop in the neighborhood, known for perfumes that match not just a scent, but a feeling?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💖 If you’d like to support the game, don’t forget to add Perfume Atelier to your Wishlist!</strong> </p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/2e01571c62df6c5cc69a6dfc83864162.avif?t=1787721682\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your own little perfume workshop, where every bottle tells a story. 🌸 Mix fragrant essences, design beautiful bottles, and share your creations with curious customers who are searching for scents that match their mood. As your atelier grows, decorate your space, unlock new recipes, and build your reputation in the gentle art of fragrance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/4971be26fb8784c882fab20f4ceab664.poster.avif?t=1787721682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/4971be26fb8784c882fab20f4ceab664.webm?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962270/extras/4971be26fb8784c882fab20f4ceab664.mp4?t=1787721682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Cozy Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide library of essences, each with its own traits. Mix and match to create perfumes that carry distinct moods, accords, and tones. Every drop counts, so use your ingredients wisely. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Bottle Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself through bottle shapes, caps, labels, and colors. There’s no wrong way to design, each creation is uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline